<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia wage decision in inflation band - Reith.</title>
<headline>Australia wage decision in inflation band - Reith.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Industrial Relations Minister Peter Reith said on Tuesday the Industrial Relations Commission's (IRC) wage ruling met the Reserve Bank of Australia's (RBA) inflation guidelines.</p>
<p>Reith said also the creation of a minimum wage for employees in the federal industrial relations system would have only a limited economic effect.</p>
<p>&quot;The macro-economic impact will be limited, but the government will be closely monitoring the impact on individual firms and employment,&quot; Reith said in a statement.</p>
</text>
